{"id":"GHSA-mjrq-cffv-q4qc","axis":"advisories","repo":"nuxt/nuxt","sha":"89d3306d1976dd52ac2e73078806a3e889cbb8bd","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"packages/schema/src/config/common.ts","lines":["@@ -5,11 +5,11 @@ import { randomUUID } from 'node:crypto'"," import { relative, resolve } from 'pathe'"," import { isDebug, isDevelopment, isTest } from 'std-env'"," import { defu } from 'defu'","-import { findWorkspaceDir } from 'pkg-types'"," "," import type { NuxtDebugOptions } from '../types/debug.ts'"," import type { NuxtModule } from '../types/module.ts'"," import { defineResolvers } from '../utils/definition.ts'","+import { findWorkspaceDir } from '../utils/workspace-dir.ts'"," import { DEFAULT_JS_FILE_EXTENSIONS } from '../constants.ts'"," "," export default defineResolvers({","@@ -24,10 +24,7 @@ export default defineResolvers({","       const rootDir = await get('rootDir')","       return val && typeof val === 'string'","         ? resolve(rootDir, val)","-        : findWorkspaceDir(rootDir, {","-            gitConfig: 'closest',","-            try: true,","-          }).catch(() => rootDir)","+        : findWorkspaceDir(rootDir)","     },","   },","   srcDir: {"],"additions":2,"deletions":5,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/schema/src/utils/workspace-dir.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@","+import { existsSync } from 'node:fs'","+import { readFile } from 'node:fs/promises'","+import { dirname, join } from 'pathe'","+","+const DECLARES_DENO_WORKSPACE_RE = /\"workspace\"\\s*:/","+","+/** Workspace files, with the pattern a file has to match to declare a workspace. */","+const WORKSPACE_FILES: Array<[file: string, declaresWorkspace?: RegExp]> = [","+  ['pnpm-workspace.yaml', /^packages\\s*:/m],","+  ['lerna.json'],","+  ['turbo.json'],","+  ['rush.json'],","+  ['deno.json', DECLARES_DENO_WORKSPACE_RE],","+  ['deno.jsonc', DECLARES_DENO_WORKSPACE_RE],","+]","+","+async function declaresWorkspace (dir: string): Promise<boolean> {","+  for (const [file, declaresWorkspace] of WORKSPACE_FILES) {","+    const path = join(dir, file)","+    if (!existsSync(path)) { continue }","+    if (!declaresWorkspace || declaresWorkspace.test(await readFile(path, 'utf8').catch(() => ''))) {","+      return true","+    }","+  }","+  return false","+}","+","+async function declaresPackageWorkspaces (path: string): Promise<boolean> {","+  try {","+    return !!JSON.parse(await readFile(path, 'utf8'))?.workspaces","+  } catch {","+    return false","+  }","+}","+","+/**","+ * Resolve the workspace directory of a project: the furthest directory with a file declaring a","+ * workspace, the closest git repository, or the closest `package.json` declaring `workspaces`,","+ * in that order. Falls back to `rootDir`.","+ */","+export async function findWorkspaceDir (rootDir: string): Promise<string> {","+  const dirs: string[] = []","+  for (let dir = rootDir; ; dir = dirname(dir)) {","+    dirs.push(dir)","+    if (dirname(dir) === dir) { break }","+  }","+","+  for (const dir of [...dirs].reverse()) {","+    if (await declaresWorkspace(dir)) { return dir }","+  }","+","+  const gitDir = dirs.find(dir => existsSync(join(dir, '.git/config')))","+  if (gitDir) { return gitDir }","+","+  for (const dir of dirs) {","+    const path = join(dir, 'package.json')","+    if (existsSync(path) && await declaresPackageWorkspaces(path)) { return dir }","+  }","+  return rootDir","+}"],"additions":60,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/schema/test/workspace-dir.spec.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@","+import { mkdir, mkdtemp, realpath, rm, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises'","+import { tmpdir } from 'node:os'","+import { join } from 'pathe'","+import { afterEach, describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'","+import { applyDefaults } from 'untyped'","+","+import { NuxtConfigSchema } from '../src/index.ts'","+import type { NuxtOptions } from '../src/index.ts'","+","+let parentDir: string","+","+async function resolveWorkspaceDir (parentFiles: Record<string, string>, projectFiles: Record<string, string>, config: { workspaceDir?: string } = {}) {","+  parentDir = await realpath(await mkdtemp(join(tmpdir(), 'nuxt-workspace-dir-')))","+  const rootDir = join(parentDir, 'project')","+  for (const [dir, files] of [[parentDir, parentFiles], [rootDir, projectFiles]] as const) {","+    for (const [file, contents] of Object.entries(files)) {","+      await mkdir(join(dir, file, '..'), { recursive: true })","+      await writeFile(join(dir, file), contents)","+    }","+  }","+  await mkdir(rootDir, { recursive: true })","+  const options = await applyDefaults(NuxtConfigSchema, { rootDir, ...config }) as unknown as NuxtOptions","+  return options.workspaceDir === rootDir ? 'project' : options.workspaceDir === parentDir ? 'parent' : options.workspaceDir","+}","+","+describe('workspaceDir', () => {","+  afterEach(async () => {","+    await rm(parentDir, { recursive: true, force: true })","+  })","+","+  it('does not resolve to a parent directory that only has a lockfile', async () => {","+    const parent = { 'package.json': '{\"dependencies\":{}}', 'package-lock.json': '{}' }","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir(parent, { 'package.json': '{}', 'package-lock.json': '{}' })).toBe('project')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir(parent, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('project')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir(parent, {})).toBe('project')","+  })","+","+  it('does not resolve to a parent directory with a workspace file that declares no workspace', async () => {","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'pnpm-workspace.yaml': 'onlyBuiltDependencies:\\n  - esbuild\\n' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('project')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'deno.json': '{\"tasks\":{}}' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('project')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'pnpm-workspace.yaml': 'onlyBuiltDependencies:\\n  - esbuild\\n' }, { '.git/config': '', 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('project')","+  })","+","+  it('resolves to a parent directory that declares a workspace', async () => {","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'pnpm-workspace.yaml': 'packages:\\n  - project\\n' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('parent')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'package.json': '{\"workspaces\":[\"project\"]}' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('parent')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'deno.json': '{\"workspace\":[\"./project\"]}' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('parent')","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'turbo.json': '{}' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('parent')","+  })","+","+  it('resolves to the closest git repository', async () => {","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ '.git/config': '', 'package-lock.json': '{}' }, { 'package.json': '{}' })).toBe('parent')","+  })","+","+  it('respects an explicit workspaceDir', async () => {","+    expect(await resolveWorkspaceDir({ 'package.json': '{\"workspaces\":[\"project\"]}' }, { 'package.json': '{}' }, { workspaceDir: '.' })).toBe('project')","+  })","+})"],"additions":58,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/vite/test/fs-allow.test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@","+import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url'","+import { mkdir, mkdtemp, realpath, rm, symlink, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises'","+import { createServer } from 'node:http'","+import type { AddressInfo } from 'node:net'","+import { tmpdir } from 'node:os'","+import { join } from 'pathe'","+import { afterAll, beforeAll, describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'","+import { buildNuxt, loadNuxt } from '@nuxt/kit'","+","+const nuxtDir = fileURLToPath(new URL('../../nuxt', import.meta.url))","+","+describe('vite dev server fs.allow', () => {","+  let parentDir: string","+  let rootDir: string","+","+  beforeAll(async () => {","+    parentDir = await realpath(await mkdtemp(join(tmpdir(), 'nuxt-fs-allow-')))","+    rootDir = join(parentDir, 'project')","+    await mkdir(join(rootDir, 'app'), { recursive: true })","+    await mkdir(join(rootDir, 'node_modules'), { recursive: true })","+    await symlink(nuxtDir, join(rootDir, 'node_modules/nuxt'), 'dir')","+    await writeFile(join(rootDir, 'app/app.vue'), '<template><div/></template>')","+    await writeFile(join(parentDir, 'secret.txt'), 'secret')","+    for (const dir of [parentDir, rootDir]) {","+      await writeFile(join(dir, 'package.json'), '{}')","+      await writeFile(join(dir, 'package-lock.json'), '{}')","+    }","+  }, 30000)","+","+  afterAll(async () => {","+    await rm(parentDir, { recursive: true, force: true })","+  })","+","+  it('should not serve files next to an ancestor lockfile', async () => {","+    const nuxt = await loadNuxt({ cwd: rootDir, dev: true })","+    const middlewares = new Promise<Parameters<typeof createServer>[1]>((resolve) => {","+      nuxt.hook('vite:serverCreated', (server, { isClient }) => {","+        if (isClient) {","+          resolve(server.middlewares)","+        }","+      })","+    })","+","+    try {","+      await buildNuxt(nuxt)","+","+      const server = createServer(await middlewares)","+      await new Promise<void>(resolve => server.listen(0, '127.0.0.1', resolve))","+      try {","+        const { port } = server.address() as AddressInfo","+        const base = `http://127.0.0.1:${port}${nuxt.options.app.buildAssetsDir}@fs`","+        const files = [join(parentDir, 'secret.txt'), join(rootDir, 'app/app.vue')]","+        expect(await Promise.all(files.map(file => fetch(base + file).then(res => res.status)))).toEqual([403, 200])","+      } finally {","+        server.close()","+      }","+    } finally {","+      await nuxt.close()","+    }","+  }, 60000)","+})",""],"additions":61,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":181,"deletions":5,"truncated":false,"file_count":4},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:12:33.158120+00:00"}